.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Secrets are never committed (CLAUDE.md rule 9). Each part keeps a .env.example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision

# Claude Code personal files
**/.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

